  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. <br>• Rinse red lentils. Cut cauliflower (including stalk!) into small florets.<br>• Place cauliflower on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.<br><br>TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide sweet potato between two trays.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d8259518d6e477003fc9d8/step-ef595400.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, heat a drizzle of olive oil in a medium saucepan over medium-high heat.<br>• Cook ginger paste, mild North Indian spice blend, Mumbai spice blend and tomato paste, stirring until fragrant, 1 minute. <br>• Add the water, coconut milk and vegetable stock powder, stirring to combine.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d8259518d6e477003fc9d8/step-eb972c10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• To the saucepan, add lentils. Bring to the boil, then reduce heat to medium.<br>• Cover with a lid and cook, stirring occasionally, until lentils are softened, 20-22 minutes. <br>• Meanwhile, roughly chop silverbeet.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d8259518d6e477003fc9d8/step-f05bfa20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Place mini flour tortillas on a second lined oven tray.<br>• Drizzle each with olive oil and season with salt.<br>• Bake until warmed through, 4-7 minutes.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d8259518d6e477003fc9d8/step-e0d45c30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Stir roasted cauliflower and silverbeet through dhal. Season to taste.<br><br>TIP: Add a splash of water to loosen the dhal, if needed.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d8259518d6e477003fc9d8/step-cd4dc040.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Thinly slice long chilli (if using).<br>• Divide mild cauliflower and silverbeet lentil dhal between bowls.<br>• Top with a dollop of Greek-style yoghurt, sprinkle over chilli and crumble over fetta cubes. <br>• Serve with tortillas. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d8259518d6e477003fc9d8/step-b29c6850.jpg"
    }
  ]
